        <h5 class="proinT">基金经理</h5>
        <div class="prManager">
            <dl class="PrIntroduce">
                <dt><img src="/upload2010/2021/12/23/073627375_0_537292b2-917e-3c6c-a4ac-b1ff3a557947.png"></dt>
                <dd>
                    <h3>倪斌</h3>
                    <ul class="netinfo clearbot">
                        <li><span>任职日期：</span>2018-09-10~至今</li>
                        <li><span>任期回报：</span>
                            
                            
                                
                                
